  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial Sustainability Activities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project covers part of the staff of the Financial Sustainability (FS) Advisors to ensure that this staff can provide advice and support the FS of NLRC&apos;s National Society partners, building on the learning and experience gained from NLRC&apos;s work with strategic partners in recent years. Overall, FS as innovative key expertise area has a total amount of EUR 250.000 available.</narrative>
  </description>
